          ],
          "text": "Macrocytic Anemia (>100fl)"
         },
         {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ": folic acid deficiency, vitamin B12 deficiency, normal newborn (MCV, 100-125), trisomy 21, medications (e.g., valproate, TMP-SMX, hydroxyurea, azathioprine), bone marrow failure (e.g., Fanconi anemia), dyserythropoietic anemia, hypothyroidism, liver disease, inborn error of metabolism (e.g., orotic aciduria, Lesch-Nyhan syndrome) "
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "attrs": {
